## Metadata Validation (`src/metadata_validator.py`)

Runs after data is loaded into MongoDB `dataRecords`. Validates individual node records.

### Per-Node Checks

| Check | Error Code | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Node type in model | M035 | `Record/node type "<type>" is not defined in the model.` |
| ID property value | M022 | `ID property, "<id>" is empty.` |
| Duplicate IDs | M016 | `Same ID also appears in <locations>.` |
| Required props empty | M003 | `Required property "<prop>" is empty.` |
| Delete required prop | M033 | `deleting value of a required property "<prop>" is not allowed.` |
| Program name match | M028, M030 | Program name vs pre-approved names |
| Study name match | M029 | Study name vs submission's study |
| Undefined property | M017 | Warning: `Property "<prop>" is not defined in the model.` |
| String permissible values | M010 | `"<value>" is not a permissible value for property "<prop>".` |
| Integer type | M004 | `"<value>" is not a valid integer type.` |
| Number type | M005 | `"<value>" is not a valid number type.` |
| Date/datetime format | M007 | `"<value>" is not a valid date type.` |
| Boolean format | M008 | `"<value>" is not a valid boolean type.` |
| String pattern (regex) | M031 | `"<value>" does not comply to string pattern for property "<prop>".` |
| Value boundary | M011/M012 | Below/above bound |
| Relationship not specified | M013 | `All related node IDs are missing.` |
| Related node not found | M014 | `Related node "<type>" <id> not found.` |
| Invalid relationship | M023 | `Relationship to a "<type>" node is not defined.` |
| One-to-one conflict | M024 | Multiple parents for 1:1 relationship |
| Many-to-one conflict | M025 | Multiple parents for N:1 relationship |
| Updating existing data | M018 | Warning: already exists, will be updated |
| Data not found (delete) | M019 | Node to delete doesn't exist in released data |
| CDE not available | M027 | CDE permissible values unavailable |
| Consent code conflict | M036 | File cannot be both controlled and open |
| Array/value-list PV | M010 | Per-item permissible value check |

### Message Prefix Format

All metadata validation messages are prefixed with:
`[<originalFileName>: line <lineNumber>]`

### Permissible Value Matching

- Case-insensitive matching with auto-correction to canonical case
- Synonym suggestion via `synonyms` MongoDB collection
- `<delete>` is always added as a valid PV

### Result Storage

Results stored in the `qcResults` MongoDB collection as structured objects (see QC Results Structure below).

