## Data Model Configuration

### Per-Data-Commons Settings

Each data commons (GC, CDS, CTDC, ICDC) is configured via `content.json` in the models repository:

| Setting | Purpose | Example |
|---|---|---|
| `model-files` | YAML files defining the model | `["model.yml", "props.yml"]` |
| `current-version` | Default model version | `"1.2.0"` |
| `omit-DCF-prefix` | Whether file IDs omit `dg.4DFC/` prefix | `true` (ICDC), `false` (GC, CDS, CTDC) |
| `file-nodes` | File node definitions (name-field, size-field, md5-field) | `{"file": {"name-field": "file_name", ...}}` |
| `main-nodes` | Entity type mappings for CRDC ID generation | `{"program": "Program", "study": "Study"}` |
| `property-names` | Configured property name mappings | `{"programName": "program_name"}` |
| `list-delimiter` | Delimiter for array/value-list properties | `"\|"` |

### Key Constants (`src/common/constants.py`)

```python
DCF_PREFIX = "dg.4DFC/"
OMIT_DCF_PREFIX = "omit-DCF-prefix"
BATCH_TYPE_METADATA = "metadata"
DELETE_COMMAND = "<delete>"
```

### Data Model Access (`src/common/model.py`)

```python
model.get_omit_dcf_prefix()    # Returns bool from content.json
model.get_file_nodes()          # Returns dict of file node definitions
model.get_node_id(node_type)    # Returns ID property name for a node
model.get_node_keys()           # Returns all node type names
model.get_node_req_props(node)  # Returns required properties
model.get_list_delimiter()      # Returns list delimiter
model.get_composition_key(node) # Returns composite key properties
```

