## MongoDB Collections

| Collection | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `batch` | Batch records with `errors[]` from essential validation |
| `submissions` | Submission records (status, intention, dataCommons, modelVersion) |
| `dataRecords` | All metadata/file node records with `qcResultID`, `additionalErrors` |
| `release` | Released/published data records |
| `qcResults` | QC validation results (metadata + file validation errors/warnings) |
| `validation` | Validation run records (tracks metadata/file validation completion) |
| `CDE` | Cached CDE permissible values |
| `synonyms` | PV synonym mappings |
| `pvConceptCodes` | Concept codes for PVs |
| `configuration` | Environment configuration (SQS names, STS config) |
| `approvedStudies` | Study records |
| `organization` | Program/organization records |
| `fileMD5` | Cached file MD5 checksums for optimization |
